    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Promoted from an NPC statblock to a player character sheet on 2026-10-04 (Waluipedia sheets suite). Ranger 3 (Hunter), Toad, background Liberated Toad.</em></p><ul><li>Ranger (Hunter) read off the record: the liberated Toad who kept to the treeline with a crossbow, tracked for the party in the Grove and cast Cure Wounds on the stump.</li><li>Standard array: DEX 15, WIS 14, CON 13, STR 12, INT 10, CHA 8 (no ability scores were ever rolled on the statblock).</li><li>Saving throws STR and DEX (Ranger); skills Stealth, Survival, Perception (class) and Insight, Nature (background).</li><li>Hit points 3d10 + 3 = 25 (die maxed at level 1, average after, CON every level).</li><li>Spells are the player's to pick in Foundry: a half caster knows three at level 3; Cure Wounds is on record.</li><li>Kit, art, token, folder and ownership kept exactly as the GM built them.</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      },
